OL,3,GNEWSAKiller who murdered flatmate
OL,4,Ajailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life for
OL,7,Fmurdering his flatmate in the UK just
OL,8,Fthree years after completing a prison
OL,9,Fsentence in Romania for a "strikingly
OL,10,Fsimilar" killing.
OL,12,FConstruction worker Eugeniu Neamtu, 59,
OL,13,Fknown as Jimmy, was found guilty of
OL,14,Ffatally stabbing his flatmate Gheorghe
OL,15,FTrica, 63, in Walthamstow, east London,
OL,16,Fon 20 February.
OL,18,FAppearing at the Old Bailey on Friday,
OL,19,FJudge Richard Marks KC sentenced Neamtu
OL,20,Fto life with a minimum term of 27
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
