OL,3,GNEWSAKiller who murdered flatmate
OL,4,Ajailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeamtu had stabbed his fellow Romanian
OL,7,FTrica in the heart in almost identical
OL,8,Fcircumstances to an earlier killing in
OL,9,Fhis home country dating back to 2006,
OL,10,Fthe court heard.
